'''Jack''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by completing all the murderer challenges in the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Halloween_Event_2015#Bingo_Challenge Bingo Challenge] during the [[Halloween Event 2015|2015 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is solid black with a purple jack o lantern face imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is purple, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*Its texture was created by [[didi1147]], better known as JD.
*It partners with the gun [[Mummy (2015)]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Jack_Set Jack Set].

